      "depth": 0,
      "text": "- Note: we had to do this with text (recall the tokenization lecture).",
      "extra": {}
    },
    {
      "kind": "claim",
      "line": 20,
      "section": "main",
      "depth": 0,
      "text": "- For non-text modalities, this is more challenging...",
      "extra": {}
    },
    {
      "kind": "claim",
      "line": 22,
      "section": "main",
      "depth": 0,
      "text": "Questions:",
